      "text": "The cartel is recruiting juveniles to do their dirty work!\n\n10/16- In Brownsville, TX, USBP agents apprehended four juveniles attempting to smuggle 245lbs. of marijuana into the U.S. One of them, just 15 years old, is a repeat offender caught doing the same thing just last month. This teen is tied to the Gulf Cartel and has multiple USBP apprehensions.\n\nThe drugs were seized, and the four teens will be charged and processed accordingly.",
